  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Yin Tae-Rim, CEO of a failing company, turns to Seo Yi-Rin, a powerful executive with a reputation for sponsoring the lovers she takes a liking to. Desperate to save his business, he makes his move, but Yi-Rin already has a new “puppy” to play with and shows no interest. Instead, she passes him along. Not to a colleague. Not to a rival. To her husband.\n\nThat’s how Tae-Rim ends up in front of Jin Ha-Kyung, the cold and unreadable head of a major company. Ha-Kyung listens, watching him squirm through an awkward explanation. Then, with a slow smile tugging at his lips, he makes a proposal that stops Tae-Rim cold.\n\n *\"Forget my wife. Try me.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
